<body>
  <header>
    <h1>CorpVPN &mdash; Remote Access Portal</h1>
    <div class="sub">vpn01.tlo-corp.local &nbsp;|&nbsp; CorpVPN/1.2.3 (Debian)</div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Your VPN Profile</h2>
      <p class="muted">Download the OpenVPN configuration below and import it into your client.</p>
      <p><a class="dl" href="/client.ovpn">Download client.ovpn</a></p>
      <p class="muted">Browse all profiles: <a href="/downloads/" style="color:#7ee787">/downloads/</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Connect</h2>
      <p class="muted">From a Linux client:</p>
      <p><code>sudo openvpn --config client.ovpn</code></p>
      <p class="muted">Once connected you will be routed into the corporate network.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Need help?</h2>
      <p class="muted">Contact IT Helpdesk. See the internal VPN runbook on the wiki for setup steps.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
